 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "RHS・品種: 花がら摘みで花が増える。MBG・NC State（種）: 花後に花穂を取ると二番花・こぼれ種を抑える。晩夏の乱れは C の切り戻しではない",
  "management_type_quote": "deadhead to encourage more flowers",
  "management_type_by_matching": "B 花後刈込型",
  "heat_west_only": "中",
  "muggy_west_only": "中",
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/同じ種の別品種（Dg05・Dg08・Dg09・Dg10・図鑑の 'Monstrosa'）] 耐暑性；中（この品種のページはない。信頼度：低）\n[NC State/種] Foxglove does best with afternoon shade.\n[読み直し 2026-11-24] 欧米の文献だけの蒸れ耐性：言い回しの照合では 空欄、文を読み直して 中（[MBG・種] Powdery mildew and leaf spot ... can depreciate foliage ... by early to mid-summer）\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: East-facing or South-facing or West-facing",
  "spread_evidence": "[こぼれ種 2／NC State・種] avoid excessive numbers of seedlings / [MBG・種] freely self-seed（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 2／MBG・種] If flower spikes are left in place after flowering and allowed to go to seed, plants will act more as biennials and will, in optimum growing conditions, freely self-seed.\n[こぼれ種の食い違い] stauden.de は 1 相当\n[増え方] こぼれ種・地下茎の段階に合わせて直した（前：株立ち）",
  "mixing_evidence": "[stauden.de・品種] Wuchsverhalten: horstig, lockerhorstig, horstbildend\n[こぼれ種 2 の基準 2026-11-24] こぼれ種 2 で、雑草化・群落・野生化の記述があるので 強い：[読み直し] [MBG・種] often establishing large colonies in optimum growing conditions",
  "silhouette_evidence": "[RHS・品種] Habit: Columnar upright",
